                        "padding-block-end": 15,
                        "padding-inline-start": 30,
                        "padding-inline-end": 30
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_3eei6p": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "text": "<p>The water activity level (measure of food safety) of our air dried meats are lower than the baseline required to inhibit the growth of pathogenic bacteria, parasites, and molds. The meat initially goes through a lethality phase during the beginning parts of dehydration, eliminating all pathogens.<br/><br/>We take a lot of pride in our quality. As such, we test all the batches prior to leaving our facility. None of the foods that leave our facility for sale or resale have tested positive for pathogens or mold. Since we started in 2007, we have not had a single incident or recall.</p>",
                            "collection_description_only": false,
