                      "blocks": {
                        "text_cTGEDk": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "text": "<p>Colour variations can actually indicate quality in natural products, such as our pet food. Because we don't use any synthetics, preservatives or dyes (which mask colour variations but are hard on your pet's organs) and use only whole foods with high bioavailabilities, anything from where produce was harvested, when it was harvested, or even small factors like seasonal changes and rainfall can contribute to variances in colour. So don't be alarmed if your next bag of Smack doesn't look quite like that last - this is actually a very good sign that indicates the high quality of our product!</p>",
                            "collection_description_only": false,
